# Dev smoke output — scripts/_smoke_* writes here; not a repo artifact.
_smoke_*.png

# Per-run measurement artifacts — all benchmark outputs land under
# ``mcp/reports/`` (charts, runs, auto-captured snapshots). The
# subtree is volatile; review historical runs with the
# ``compare_snapshots`` tool, not git.
#
# Legacy location ``mcp/snapshots/`` kept ignored for backward
# compatibility — older clones may still write there until they
# rebase onto the consolidated layout.
reports/
snapshots/
